The '''Shili system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Ehosiq sector]] of the [[Expansion Region]]<ref name="Appendix" /> and [[Togruta space]]<ref name="TRS" /> that contained the [[planet]] [[Shili]],<ref name="Leia" /> [[homeworld]] of the [[Togruta]].<ref name="Togruta" /> The system was situated in grid square L-8 of the [[Standard Galactic Grid]].<ref name="Appendix" />

